5308, 4352 and 7348 respectively. The task of direct verification of the Jacobian con-
jecture by computation for those pairs of polynomials with the said degrees is beyond
the capacity of a large Computer. In this Appendix we shall illustrate some methods to
reduce the numbers of coefficients, and then settle the problems of computations.
