full exact Groebner basis was not launched. This verdict is not a timeout
masquerading as emptiness; it is both a scope failure and a declared system
size.

## 8. What generalizes

No h_pi-absorption lemma is proved here from `u_s=1` and `k>=2` alone.
Equation (5.4) shows that absorption depends on the actual correction module,
while the primitive smooth component proves only that the raw monomial
exponent is not an obstruction. Any valid descendant-wide version must also
include the licensed inherited correction module. The first proof-shaped
uniform statement is:

> For each licensed inherited state and each first Newton weight/Kummer
> character in which the bottom residual occurs, the class of
> `gamma^k h_pi` is outside the image of the associated-graded linearized
> correction map; nonlinear terms are triangular in later weights.

That statement would imply failure by induction on weight, but it requires
the whole inherited support and a proof of triangularity. It is not presently
proved for every `u_s=1` descendant.

The cheapest uniform test is therefore one sparse rational linear page:
OPEN              DESCENT-STATE-S3; DESCENT-WINDOW-TOP; bottom-block
                  correction-image test; inverse descent.
NOT CLAIMED       any target component, target emptiness, k[x,y] pair,
                  original D=108 realization, or general u_s=1 theorem.
